"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P907206312" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>We've got reports of a major force heading straight for the PPD Headquarters. <t=8 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>It's up to you all to hold the line and push them back! <t=8 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>Make sure to reactivate the police drones around the area to form a defensive perimeter!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P871121025" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>Something just hit Blyde Square hard, {TaskForceName}! <t=8 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>I've lost touch with Valkyrie and the PPD stationed in the area. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue> The last report I had was that it was some sort of object from space, but one sergeant claimed it was a person. I'll keep you briefed on the situation."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P786754658" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>There's a massive force surrounding the station, watch out!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3733685391" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>This is Blue Steel. I'm in the southern portion of Kings Row. <t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>We need your help in quelling a lot of monster activity in the sewers. The Rikti and Hydra are forming a massive army down there.<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>Positron believes that the Praetorians are working together with the Rikti to try to destroy Paragon from within!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P134831051" "<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateBlue>That should help clear the sewers out. We need you to secure the PPD station ASAP!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2045649909" "Reward"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"

