// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3187922693" "This technician helps the PPD with their police drones."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1839139467" "<em><em><shout>Hey! {TaskForceName}!<em>We've lost contact with the main PPD headquarters.<em>Take the devices in these boxes.<em><em>You can use them to re-activate the drones placed around the PPD headquarters.<em><em>We've programmed them to go after any Clockwork that come through, though more powerful ones may not be targetted by their systems.<em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em>Just take some devices from the boxes behind me to power up the drones in the station.<em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em>Use the devices in the boxes behind me to power up the police drones at the PPD headquarters.<em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em><em>Those drones at the station can help you fight the Clockwork, as long as you take the devices in these boxes."

