"P3948776100" "<t=10 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=10><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>You are all fools if you believe you can defeat the great Battle Maiden! My minions will make quick work of you!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3361606947" "<t=10 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=10><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGreen>Impressive, you aren't weakened like the others. I look forward to putting you all down like the dogs you are!"
